[{"id":77749575,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQ3Nzc0OTU3NQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/77749575","actor":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2013-11-23T15:15:02Z","assignee":{"login":"qiangxue","id":993322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5MzMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/993322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue","html_url":"https://github.com/qiangxue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/29135480","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1301#issuecomment-29135480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1301","id":29135480,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5MTM1NDgw","user":{"login":"cebe","id":189796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4OTc5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe","html_url":"https://github.com/cebe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-11-23T16:27:49Z","updated_at":"2013-11-23T16:27:49Z","body":"You are right, scenario is in most cases not needed in rules(). Your examples are equivalent. \n\nBut you can specify rules() without defining scenarios() method which will result in the scenarios() method to determine the scenarios and active attributes based on the definitions in rules().\nThis is what sceanrios is mostly used for in rules()\n\n> // rule applied when corresponding field is \"safe\"\n\nis not 100% correct.\nrule is applied when field is **active**: https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/blob/master/docs/guide/model.md#active-attributes\n\n> rule applied when scenario is \"signup\" no matter if field is \"safe\" or not\n\nThis will not be applied as the attribute is not active on signup as defined by your scenarios() method. Actually I just found that the current implementation is not correct according to docs and how it should be. Will fix this.\n\nExample:\n\n``` php\nfunction rules()\n{\n    return [\n        // rule applied when corresponding field is \"active\"\n        ['username', 'string', 'length' => [4, 32]],\n        ['first_name', 'string', 'max' => 128],\n        ['password', 'required'],\n\n        // rule applied when scenario is \"signup\" no matter if field is \"safe\" or not\n        ['hashcode', 'check', 'on' => 'signup'],\n    ];\n}\n// this will result in scenarios beeing auto detected as:\n[\n        'default' => ['username', 'password', 'first_name'],\n        'signup' => ['username', 'password', 'first_name', 'hashcode'],\n];\n}\n```\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/29135480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cebe","id":189796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4OTc5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe","html_url":"https://github.com/cebe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":77754286,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQ3Nzc1NDI4Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/77754286","actor":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2013-11-23T17:01:58Z","assignee":{"login":"cebe","id":189796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4OTc5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe","html_url":"https://github.com/cebe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cebe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/29156626","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1301#issuecomment-29156626","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1301","id":29156626,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5MTU2NjI2","user":{"login":"o-rey","id":5132302,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzIzMDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5132302?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey","html_url":"https://github.com/o-rey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-11-24T14:30:53Z","updated_at":"2013-11-24T14:30:53Z","body":"Btw 'except' does not affect scenario fields.\nGiven this set of rules,\n\n``` php\nreturn [\n    [['id'], 'required', 'except' => 'administration'],\n    [['name', 'description'], 'filter', 'filter' => 'trim'],\n    [['is_disabled'], 'boolean', 'on' => 'administration'],\n];\n```\n\nthese scenarios are generated:\n\n``` php\nArray\n(\n    [administration] => Array\n        (\n            [0] => is_disabled\n            [1] => id\n            [2] => name\n            [3] => description\n        )\n\n    [default] => Array\n        (\n            [0] => id\n            [1] => name\n            [2] => description\n        )\n\n)\n```\n\nAs you can see in this case the field \"id\" is still present in 'administration' scenario. I suppose this behavior should be either documented or fixed also.\n\nAnd it does not produce any new scenario, so in this example:\n\n``` php\nreturn [\n    [['id'], 'required', 'except' => 'suddenlyUnexpectedScenario'],\n    [['name', 'description'], 'filter', 'filter' => 'trim'],\n    [['is_disabled'], 'boolean', 'on' => 'administration'],\n];\n```\n\nthe scenario list remain the same: 'default' + 'administration', and no 'suddenlyUnexpectedScenario'.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/29156626/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"o-rey","id":5132302,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzIzMDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5132302?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey","html_url":"https://github.com/o-rey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o-rey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":77799797,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50Nzc3OTk3OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/77799797","actor":{"login":"qiangxue","id":993322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5MzMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/993322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url"